# The visionOS app icon's layer images. Icon Composer can't author visionOS, so
# this catalog is hand-built and its PNGs are SOURCE, not artifacts — without
# them the .solidimagestack Contents.json point at nothing and the visionOS
# target fails to build on a fresh clone. (Regenerate: macos/tools/icons/build_visionos_icon.py)
!macos/M1K3visionOS/**/*.png
# Launch site is self-contained (no CDN): its og card + favicons must travel.
!site/**/*.png
# Brand/icon assets (app-icon iconset + previews, labyrinth marks) must travel.
!assets/**/*.png
# Icon Composer app-icon layer images must travel with the repo (actool needs them).
!macos/M1K3.icon/Assets/**
!app/3d/**/*.png
# Session memory and private notes stay local-only in the public repo.
# Anchored re-include pattern for the tooling that does travel.
!/.claude/
/.claude/*
/.claude/project-memory*.md
# Project skills are repo tooling (like the tracked agents/ + commands/) — they
# document this codebase's pipelines, so they travel with it.
!/.claude/skills/
!/.claude/skills/**
# Private planning/marketing notes and scratch space never travel.
/marketing/
/scratch/
# Nested per-surface session dirs (agent memory) stay local too.
/macos/.claude/
/app/.claude/

# --- Private runtime data: must NEVER be committed (access-readiness) ---
# Personal conversation history / vector store
databases/
*.duckdb
*.duckdb.wal
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
# Local session state (machine/runtime status)
.m1k3_session.json
# Generated test reports (embed absolute local paths)
data/test-results/

# graphify knowledge graph: generated/regenerable (~18M), goes stale on edits.
# Collaborators run `graphify update .` locally; CLAUDE.md rules are conditional
# on graphify-out/ existing. The .graphifyignore config + skill ARE tracked.
graphify-out/

# Brain-at-home Phase A spike evidence: committed ON PURPOSE (RESULTS.md is
# the phase's verdict gate; the scripts are the reproducible instrument).
# The global excludesfile ignores scratch/ wholesale, so re-open exactly this
# path — a negation chain, not `git add -f`, so it can't regress. NOTE: this
# is a HARDER pattern than the visionOS-PNG re-include above — that one only
# re-includes a file EXTENSION under never-excluded dirs, so one `!` rule
# suffices. Here whole DIRECTORIES are excluded, and git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent dir is excluded — hence each ancestor is un-ignored
# individually before the final `**`. Don't copy the simpler PNG shape for a
# directory exclusion; it silently fails. Everything else under macos/scratch
# stays ignored (verified: `git check-ignore -v` ignores a sibling scratch
# dir AND a stray file directly in brain-at-home/, keeps spikes/ trackable).
!macos/scratch/
macos/scratch/**
!macos/scratch/brain-at-home/
!macos/scratch/brain-at-home/spikes/
!macos/scratch/brain-at-home/spikes/**
